    "enUS": {
      "description": "The Scourge is camped upon our very doorstep; we cannot remain idle! Surely you will step up to defend the Undercity from these accursed invaders? \n \nThere are strange runic circles outside, glowing with the same energy that surrounds the undead and the Necropolis above. They have significance, I'm certain, and I want you to find out what. Thin the numbers of those aberrations while you're at it; bring me proof of their death along with your results, and I will reward you.  Go!",
      "eventObjectiveLabel": "Investigate a circle",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Dim Necrotic Stone: {current}/{required}",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Investigate a circle",
          "type": "event"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Collect three Dim Necrotic Stones from the Scourge outside the Undercity and investigate the glowing runic circles near their encampment.",
      "title": "Investigate the Scourge of the Undercity",
